# When .easignore exists, EAS Build uses it INSTEAD of .gitignore to decide
# which files are uploaded to the build server.
#
# We re-list everything from .gitignore EXCEPT the items below, which we
# explicitly want available at build time:
#   - .env / .env.* (EXPO_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_* and similar)
#   - GoogleService-Info.plist (referenced by app.config.js -> ios.googleServicesFile)
#   - google-services.json (Android equivalent)

node_modules/
.expo/
.expo-shared/
dist/
build/
*.log
coverage/
.DS_Store
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
